prompt kg with the fleet running; Sound's queue led with the Lantern faces, and a four-reader survey went first because no booked shape existed.
think The survey's load-bearing findings: Lantern stands at laps 0-33 GREEN as bounded request/response inference with no face; Realidream is pond apps painting a styled Skate grid (the BUHR J-rung tradition of bounded pond proofs, while the equinox itself stays word-gated with Keaton as owner); the whole rendering road exists (.brush -> parse -> Frame -> 40x8 grid via brushstroke/skate_grid -> readback and lit proof) with seated bounds of 8 lines, 40 columns clipping silently, 128-byte nib; and the Glow gate shop can state a face law with parity anchors, the skate-gates precedent. The lane grant: the seat card names the Lantern faces as Sound's work and the BATON Keaton kg'd named it the next door.
think The face, the mechanism: pond/apps/lantern_face.rye imports brushstroke/skate_grid.rye alone and paints one exchange onto the first three rows of the 40x8 proof geometry -- a question row marked "? ", an answer row marked ". ", and a settledness marker row "= settled|proposed|unknown". Constants face_cols 40, prefix_width 2, max_face_text 38 with the said-why naming the subtraction; FaceError carries EmptyQuestion, QuestionTooWide, AnswerTooWide, EmptyAnswer, AnswerWithUnknown, every refusal landing before the first put_line so a refused face leaves the grid as it found it -- refused by name rather than clipped, since put_line clips at forty silently. The voice's contract is structural: an unknown that carries an answer refuses (AnswerWithUnknown), and unknown's answer row speaks the first-class "~ i don't know". Seven selftest legs prove the three kinds by row_cells readback, the width refusal with the grid proven untouched, the invented-certainty refusal, the two empties, and the exact 38-byte welcome. All GREEN on the first build.
think The wall in both languages: src/gate/gate-lantern-face-text-u32.glow speaks the 38-byte budget as a one-conditional desk, the worker allowlist gains the stem, and tools/l/lantern_face_witness.rish proves the whole movement -- build and legs, gate(38) lawful and gate(39) refusing on metal, and parity greps holding max_face_text in the Rye and (gth sample 38) in the Glow to one number.
